<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    padding: '0 72px',
    background: '#FFFFFF',
}}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 720, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{
            height: 120,
            paddingTop: 20,
            paddingBottom: 16,
            flexDirection: 'column',
            justifyContent: 'flex-end',
        }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 6, background: '#97C459', marginBottom: 14 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B1F1A' }}>
                What the brief asks, what answers it
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 34 }}>
            <Box style={{
                width: 292,
                background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #04342C 0%, #0F6E56 100%)',
                padding: '30px 26px',
                flexDirection: 'column',
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 13, color: '#97C459', letterSpacing: 1.8 }}>
                    THEME 05 · REQUIREMENTS
                </Text>
                <Text style={{
                    fontFamily: 'Inter',
                    fontSize: 23,
                    fontWeight: 'bold',
                    lineHeight: 1.45,
                    color: '#FFFFFF',
                    marginTop: 20,
                }}>
                    Eight asks from the brief. Each one has a mechanism, and each mechanism has a named check that fails the build when it regresses.
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 20 }}>
                    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: 'rgba(225,245,238,0.28)', marginBottom: 16 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.55, color: 'rgba(225,245,238,0.86)' }}>
                        No row here is a claim without an executable test behind it. The check names are the ones printed by the benchmark and the evaluation script.
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 810, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingBottom: 10, borderBottom: '2px solid #04342C' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12, color: '#6B7280', letterSpacing: 1.5, width: 246 }}>
                        REQUIREMENT
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12, color: '#6B7280', letterSpacing: 1.5, flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        MECHANISM
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12, color: '#6B7280', letterSpacing: 1.5, width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        ENFORCED BY
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 59, borderBottom: '1px solid #E1F5EE' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16.5, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F1A', width: 246, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        Retrieve before the utterance ends
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                        Retrieval starts from a settled transcript prefix, ahead of the model's tool call.
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            speculative_retrieval_start
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 59, borderBottom: '1px solid #E1F5EE' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16.5, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F1A', width: 246, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        Stay alive without losing depth
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                        The acknowledgement comes from the instruction diff, never the corpus, and is audited.
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            fast_path_acknowledgement
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 59, borderBottom: '1px solid #E1F5EE' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16.5, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F1A', width: 246, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        Recover from interruptions
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                        Cancellation is branch-granular. Three barge-ins cause no cancellation and no restart.
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            selective_cancellation · burst_barge_in
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 59, borderBottom: '1px solid #E1F5EE' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16.5, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F1A', width: 246, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        Goal changes keep context
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                        A refinement patches the plan; a replacement starts clean but carries what was surfaced.
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            slot_retention
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 59, borderBottom: '1px solid #E1F5EE' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16.5, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F1A', width: 246, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        Drive toward the end goal
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                        The manifest splits retrieval from anything that answers a question and must block.
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            tool_behavior
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 59, borderBottom: '1px solid #E1F5EE' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16.5, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F1A', width: 246, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        A harness safe with state
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                        Typed bounded tools, one idempotent write, scope supersession, and an audit log.
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            idempotent_write · superseded_write
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 59, borderBottom: '1px solid #E1F5EE' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16.5, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F1A', width: 246, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        Low latency, full reasoning
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                        The fast path is measured against a budget; cancellation latency runs on a virtual clock.
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            fast_path · selective_cancellation
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 59, borderBottom: '1px solid #E1F5EE' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 16.5, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F1A', width: 246, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        Multimodal, scoped, fault-tolerant
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1, paddingLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                        Image into slots; no profile reaches the engine; malformed calls rejected before touching state.
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 244, paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            vision · dropped_transport · malformed
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{
            height: 60,
            paddingBottom: 20,
            flexDirection: 'row',
            alignItems: 'center',
            justifyContent: 'space-between',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7280' }}>
                Talent Atlas · Samsung PRISM Y2026 · Theme 05
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7280' }}>
                04 / 12
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
